{"text":{"en":{"삼정오일씰 규격표 | [회사명] 베어링":"Samjung Oil Seal Spec Table | [Company Name] Bearing","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Samjung Oil Seal Sizes</p> <h2>삼정오일씰 규격표</h2> <p>삼정오일씰(oilseal.co.kr)에서 공개한 규격표를 기준으로 정리한 내경×외경×두께 목록입니다. 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p> <p style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin-top: 8px;\">○ = NOK·삼정·대광 3사 규격 모두 겹침 · ★ = NOK·삼정 겹침 · △ = 삼정·대광 겹침 · ⬠ = NOK·대광 겹침</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Samjung Oil Seal Sizes</p> <h2>Samjung Oil Seal Spec Table</h2> <p>A list of bore × O.D. × thickness sizes compiled based on the spec table published by Samjung Oil Seal (oilseal.co.kr). You can search by entering just part of the dimensions.</p> <p style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin-top: 8px;\">○ = Matches all 3 companies' specs (NOK · Samjung · Daekwang) · ★ = Matches NOK · Samjung · △ = Matches Samjung · Daekwang · ⬠ = Matches NOK · Daekwang</p>","<label for=\"sjFilter\">규격 검색</label> <input id=\"sjFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: 25*40 또는 25\" autocomplete=\"off\">":"<label for=\"sjFilter\">Spec Search</label> <input id=\"sjFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. 25*40 or 25\" autocomplete=\"off\">","※ 위 표는 삼정오일씰에서 공개한 규격표를 기준으로 작성했습니다. 정밀 가공·발주 전에는 반드시 당사 정식 규격표 원본으로 최종 확인하시기 바랍니다.":"※ This table is based on the spec sheet published by Samjung Oil Seal. Before precision machining or ordering, please always do a final check against our official spec sheet.","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Samjung Oil Seal Sizes</p> <h2>삼정오일씰 규격표</h2> <p>삼정오일씰(oilseal.co.kr)에서 공개한 규격표를 기준으로 정리한 내경×외경×두께 목록입니다. 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p> <p style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin-top: 8px;\">○ = NOK·삼정·대광 3사 규격 모두 겹침 &nbsp;·&nbsp; ★ = NOK·삼정 겹침 &nbsp;·&nbsp; △ = 삼정·대광 겹침 &nbsp;·&nbsp; ⬠ = NOK·대광 겹침</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Samjung Oil Seal Sizes</p> <h2>Samjung Oil Seal Specification Table</h2> <p>A list of bore × outer diameter × thickness compiled from the specification table published by Samjung Oil Seal (oilseal.co.kr). You can search by entering just part of a dimension.</p> <p style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin-top: 8px;\">○ = size shared by all three: NOK, Samjung and Daekwang &nbsp;·&nbsp; ★ = shared by NOK and Samjung &nbsp;·&nbsp; △ = shared by Samjung and Daekwang &nbsp;·&nbsp; ⬠ = shared by NOK and Daekwang</p>","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">형태 참고용 개념도 (SWS 카탈로그 실측 도면·NOK 등 제조사 도면 아님) — 일반적인 오일씰(스프링·더스트 립 있는 형식) 단면</p> <svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 240\" width=\"340\" height=\"227\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto;\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <g stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"> <line x1=\"108\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"88\"> <line x1=\"108\" y1=\"152\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"152\"> </g> <line x1=\"128\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"252\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 3 2 3\"> <text x=\"236\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">축</text> <g> <path d=\"M150,40 H200 V58 H188 L180,88 L172,86 L170,66 H162 L154,86 L150,84 Z\" fill=\"#dddddd\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"> <path d=\"M156,45 H196 V51 H162 V62 H156 Z\" fill=\"#999999\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"> <circle cx=\"189\" cy=\"73\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"> </g> <g transform=\"translate(0,240) scale(1,-1)\"> <path d=\"M150,40 H200 V58 H188 L180,88 L172,86 L170,66 H162 L154,86 L150,84 Z\" fill=\"#dddddd\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"> <path d=\"M156,45 H196 V51 H162 V62 H156 Z\" fill=\"#999999\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"> <circle cx=\"189\" cy=\"73\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"> </g> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"114\" y2=\"40\"> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"114\" y2=\"200\"> <line x1=\"120\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"200\" marker-start=\"url(#sjArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#sjArrow)\"> <line x1=\"175\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"175\" y2=\"152\" marker-start=\"url(#sjArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#sjArrow)\"> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"18\"> <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"18\"> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"24\" marker-start=\"url(#sjArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#sjArrow)\"> </g> <text x=\"108\" y=\"125\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">D</text> <text x=\"182\" y=\"125\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">d</text> <text x=\"175\" y=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">H</text> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"196\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"40\"> <line x1=\"194\" y1=\"73\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"70\"> <line x1=\"182\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"100\"> <line x1=\"153\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"214\"> </g> <text x=\"262\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">금속 케이스</text> <text x=\"262\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">스프링</text> <text x=\"262\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">주 립</text> <text x=\"140\" y=\"228\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">더스트 립</text> <text x=\"262\" y=\"200\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">오른쪽: 오일 측</text> <text x=\"262\" y=\"215\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">왼쪽: 외부(먼지) 측</text> <defs> <marker id=\"sjArrow\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"3\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#666\"> </marker> </defs> </svg> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d(내경 = 축 지름) · D(외경 = 하우징 구멍 지름) · H(두께) — 표의 d·D·H 열이 이 위치입니다. TYPE에 따라 더스트 립·스프링 유무, 금속 케이스의 고무 피복 여부가 달라지며(예: 더스트 립이 없는 형식도 있음), 개념도 비례는 실제와 다를 수 있습니다.</p>":"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">Conceptual diagram for shape reference only (not an SWS catalog measured drawing or a drawing from NOK or other manufacturers) — cross-section of a typical oil seal (type with spring and dust lip)</p> <svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 240\" width=\"340\" height=\"227\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto;\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <g stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"> <line x1=\"108\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"88\"> <line x1=\"108\" y1=\"152\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"152\"> </g> <line x1=\"128\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"252\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 3 2 3\"> <text x=\"236\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">Shaft</text> <g> <path d=\"M150,40 H200 V58 H188 L180,88 L172,86 L170,66 H162 L154,86 L150,84 Z\" fill=\"#dddddd\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"> <path d=\"M156,45 H196 V51 H162 V62 H156 Z\" fill=\"#999999\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"> <circle cx=\"189\" cy=\"73\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"> </g> <g transform=\"translate(0,240) scale(1,-1)\"> <path d=\"M150,40 H200 V58 H188 L180,88 L172,86 L170,66 H162 L154,86 L150,84 Z\" fill=\"#dddddd\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"> <path d=\"M156,45 H196 V51 H162 V62 H156 Z\" fill=\"#999999\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"> <circle cx=\"189\" cy=\"73\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"> </g> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"114\" y2=\"40\"> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"114\" y2=\"200\"> <line x1=\"120\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"200\" marker-start=\"url(#sjArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#sjArrow)\"> <line x1=\"175\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"175\" y2=\"152\" marker-start=\"url(#sjArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#sjArrow)\"> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"18\"> <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"18\"> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"24\" marker-start=\"url(#sjArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#sjArrow)\"> </g> <text x=\"108\" y=\"125\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">D</text> <text x=\"182\" y=\"125\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">d</text> <text x=\"175\" y=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">H</text> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"196\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"40\"> <line x1=\"194\" y1=\"73\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"70\"> <line x1=\"182\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"100\"> <line x1=\"153\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"214\"> </g> <text x=\"262\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">Metal case</text> <text x=\"262\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">Spring</text> <text x=\"262\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">Main lip</text> <text x=\"140\" y=\"228\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">Dust lip</text> <text x=\"262\" y=\"200\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">Right: oil side</text> <text x=\"262\" y=\"215\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">Left: outside (dust) side</text> <defs> <marker id=\"sjArrow\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"3\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#666\"> </marker> </defs> </svg> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d (bore = shaft diameter) · D (outer diameter = housing bore diameter) · H (thickness) — these are the d, D and H columns in the table. Depending on the TYPE, the presence of a dust lip or spring and whether the metal case is rubber-covered differ (e.g. some types have no dust lip), and the diagram’s proportions may differ from the actual product.</p>"},"ja":{"삼정오일씰 규격표 | [회사명] 베어링":"三正オイルシール規格表 | [会社名] ベアリング","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Samjung Oil Seal Sizes</p> <h2>삼정오일씰 규격표</h2> <p>삼정오일씰(oilseal.co.kr)에서 공개한 규격표를 기준으로 정리한 내경×외경×두께 목록입니다. 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p> <p style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin-top: 8px;\">○ = NOK·삼정·대광 3사 규격 모두 겹침 · ★ = NOK·삼정 겹침 · △ = 삼정·대광 겹침 · ⬠ = NOK·대광 겹침</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Samjung Oil Seal Sizes</p> <h2>三正オイルシール規格表</h2> <p>三正オイルシール(oilseal.co.kr)が公開した規格表に基づいて整理した内径×外径×厚さの一覧です。寸法の一部だけ入力しても検索できます。</p> <p style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin-top: 8px;\">○ = NOK・三正・大光の3社規格すべてに一致 ・ ★ = NOK・三正に一致 ・ △ = 三正・大光に一致 ・ ⬠ = NOK・大光に一致</p>","<label for=\"sjFilter\">규격 검색</label> <input id=\"sjFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: 25*40 또는 25\" autocomplete=\"off\">":"<label for=\"sjFilter\">規格検索</label> <input id=\"sjFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"例: 25*40 または 25\" autocomplete=\"off\">","※ 위 표는 삼정오일씰에서 공개한 규격표를 기준으로 작성했습니다. 정밀 가공·발주 전에는 반드시 당사 정식 규격표 원본으로 최종 확인하시기 바랍니다.":"※ 上記の表は三正オイルシールが公開した規格表に基づき作成しました。精密加工・発注前には必ず当社正式規格表原本で最終確認してください。","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Samjung Oil Seal Sizes</p> <h2>삼정오일씰 규격표</h2> <p>삼정오일씰(oilseal.co.kr)에서 공개한 규격표를 기준으로 정리한 내경×외경×두께 목록입니다. 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p> <p style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin-top: 8px;\">○ = NOK·삼정·대광 3사 규격 모두 겹침 &nbsp;·&nbsp; ★ = NOK·삼정 겹침 &nbsp;·&nbsp; △ = 삼정·대광 겹침 &nbsp;·&nbsp; ⬠ = NOK·대광 겹침</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Samjung Oil Seal Sizes</p> <h2>三正オイルシール規格表</h2> <p>三正オイルシール(oilseal.co.kr)が公開している規格表を基に整理した内径×外径×厚さの一覧です。寸法の一部を入力するだけで検索できます。</p> <p style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin-top: 8px;\">○ = NOK・三正・大光の3社規格すべてに共通 &nbsp;·&nbsp; ★ = NOK・三正に共通 &nbsp;·&nbsp; △ = 三正・大光に共通 &nbsp;·&nbsp; ⬠ = NOK・大光に共通</p>","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">형태 참고용 개념도 (SWS 카탈로그 실측 도면·NOK 등 제조사 도면 아님) — 일반적인 오일씰(스프링·더스트 립 있는 형식) 단면</p> <svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 240\" width=\"340\" height=\"227\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto;\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <g stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"> <line x1=\"108\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"88\"> <line x1=\"108\" y1=\"152\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"152\"> </g> <line x1=\"128\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"252\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 3 2 3\"> <text x=\"236\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">축</text> <g> <path d=\"M150,40 H200 V58 H188 L180,88 L172,86 L170,66 H162 L154,86 L150,84 Z\" fill=\"#dddddd\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"> <path d=\"M156,45 H196 V51 H162 V62 H156 Z\" fill=\"#999999\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"> <circle cx=\"189\" cy=\"73\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\